  "motivation": "The code changes address security vulnerabilities related to string escaping in filter expressions across various vector store implementations. Specifically, the changes aim to prevent injection attacks and syntax errors by correctly escaping special characters (like quotes and backslashes) within string values used in filters. This issue was tracked as #4545.",
